# ── Secrets — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build assets live in ~/riparr-build/ (deliberately outside this repo).
# These patterns are belt-and-braces in case anything is ever copied in.
riparr_key
riparr_key.pub
*.pem
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*
user_password.txt
user_password.hash
# custom.toml holds the derived Wi-Fi PSK
custom.toml
known_hosts
ssh_config

# ── Large binaries ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.img
*.img.xz
*.zip

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── PyInstaller, from building the Preparer ───────────────────────────
tools/preparer/build/
tools/preparer/dist/
*.spec

# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# ── Kept, but not published ───────────────────────────────────────────
# The decision log, the working journal and the design notes are the record of how this
# was built and why. They stay on disk and out of the repository: they are working
# notes, not documentation, and publishing them puts the process on show rather than
# the product. A copy lives in ~/riparr-private-docs.
JOURNAL.md
DECISIONS.md
server/DECISIONS.md
docs/design/

# Staged by the release build: the appliance tree copied next to the Preparer so it
# can be bundled with one --add-data. Never committed; rebuilt on every release.
tools/preparer/payload/
